<title>USA: Technical Chemicals gets Walgreen order.</title>
<headline>Technical Chemicals gets Walgreen order.</headline>
<dateline>POMPANO BEACH, Fla. 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Technical Chemicals &amp; Products Inc said Tuesday that Walgreen Co Co placed an initial order for the company's HealthCheck line of over-the-counter diagnostic products.</p>
<p>A company spokesman told Reuters that while the dollar amount of the initial order may not be considered by some to be material, the potential for future business with Walgreen and other potential customers is large.</p>
</text>
